# ---- python ------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ---- scratch -------------------------------------------------------------
backup/readback.bin
*.bak

# NOTE: resources/ (~290 MB of vendor docs) is deliberately NOT ignored -- it
# was already committed in "setup", so ignoring it now would reclaim nothing
# while producing a 6,522-file deletion commit. See README if you ever want to
# purge it from history properly.

